title Vinyl now playing, 480x320 (draft Main.dc.html): the demonstration queue playing track 3 of 20
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect text "Phoenix"
expect text "Fences Remixes, 2013"
expect text "Vol 60"
expect text "Evolve 65, music quality"
expect text "WAV 44.1 kHz / 16 bit"
expect noquit
